## The track at dawn

::bg{location="track" time="morning"}
::actor{character="mika" anchor="center" action="fadeInUp"}
@narrator{code="0010"}: Mika runs the last bend alone, then folds onto the grass with his hand wrapped round his ankle.
@mika{code="0010" emotion="hurt"}: Don't — it's nothing. It's been nothing for three weeks.
@mika{code="0020" emotion="laughing"}: The relay's on Saturday, before the lanterns. If Coach sees me limp, I'm on the bench. So I won't limp.
@mika{code="0030" emotion="sad"}: You won't tell him. Right?

<branch id="injury" prompt="Mika is still holding his ankle.">
  <choice id="keep" text="Promise to keep it secret">
    @mika{code="0040" emotion="happy"}: You're the best. Seriously. I'll win it for you, then.
    ::set{run.aff.mika += 2}
  </choice>
  <choice id="urge" text="Tell him to see the nurse himself">
    @mika{code="0050" emotion="neutral"}: ...Yeah. Maybe. After the relay.
    ::set{run.aff.mika += 1}
  </choice>
  <choice id="coach" text="Walk straight to Coach Dunmore">
    @coach{code="0010"}: Sato! Bench. Ice. Now. The transfer did you a favour.
    @mika{code="0060" emotion="hurt"}: A favour. Sure. Thanks for the favour.
    @ren{code="0010" os}: That was the responsible thing. I'll make a note.
    ::set{run.aff.ren += 1}
    ::assert{locked(mika)}
  </choice>
</branch>
